From 3b580bb994f09a8721526ffb901b9f7dfb8d5e7a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 09:44:48 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Try-On: tilt the sweatpants band (lower in front, unchanged
 at the back)

The sweatpants band was lowered all the way round, so the back sat as low as the front. It is now tilted: above the seat the band goes down at the front (3 cm under the navel), not at all at the back, and part of the way at the sides. On the 217 simulated fits of the body bank the front lands 2-3 cm under the navel, the back stays about 6 cm higher, and the push off the skin halves (2 mm on average against 4 mm). The shorts are unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018jPcpWq6gasksWFg8o2kes
